  "schema_notes": {
    "2.1": "Added milestone_targets (per-milestone target dates). Consumed by the SmartGrid Tier 2 Schedule card. Values are nominal \u2014 if a project doesn't publish this field, the smartgrid falls back to even-spacing between project_start_date and tapeout_date and marks the derived dates 'estimated'.",
