    "1.0": "Original \u2014 enabled_flows only.",
    "scoping": "enabled_flows_by_discipline is PER-PROJECT SCOPING, not a catalog mirror \u2014 a project may legitimately disable DFT/DV flows it does not run. The framework catalog (flow_registry.tcl flow(types)) is the superset; a project's lists are subsets."
